        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 132438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La gestione degli errori in Express è una parte fondamentale.</p><p>Non possiamo aspettarci che il client invii dati perfetti e privi di errori, quindi è importante eseguire la validazione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 132439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con <code>res.status</code>, impostiamo lo stato HTTP della risposta.</p><p><code>500 Internal Server Error</code> indica che il server ha riscontrato un problema imprevisto che gli ha impedito di completare la richiesta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>res</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>status</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>500</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 132444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>È buona pratica restituire un messaggio di errore e il codice di stato.</p><p>Garantisce che il client riceva una descrizione dell'errore chiara e leggibile dalla macchina, comunemente utilizzata nelle API per standardizzare la gestione degli errori.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"error\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;An error occurred&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.json</code>, seguito da <code>error:</code> e infine <code>\"An error occurred\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invia un messaggio di errore con il codice di stato, così il client riceve una descrizione chiara che può elaborare.</p><p>Usa un oggetto JSON con un campo <code>error</code> contenente <code>An error occurred</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"error\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;An error occurred&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message:\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".redirect\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.json</code>, seguito da <code>error:</code> e infine <code>\"An error occurred\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se ci serve un determinato parametro per elaborare una richiesta, è meglio convalidarlo prima di procedere.<br /><br /><br /></p><p>Se manca il parametro, possiamo restituire una risposta con il codice di stato HTTP <code>400 Bad Request</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!req.query.id) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`You passed in \" /><text value=\"${req.query.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>!req.query.id</code> e infine <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Convalida i parametri obbligatori prima di elaborare una richiesta.</p><p>Usa <code>400 Bad Request</code> quando un input obbligatorio manca o è vuoto.</p><p>Restituisci quello stato quando la query <code>id</code> manca o è vuota; altrimenti, invia il suo valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!req.query.id) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`You passed in \" /><text value=\"${req.query.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.id\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.body.id\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>!req.query.id</code> e infine <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 132442,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lo stesso vale per i parametri del percorso. Un parametro del percorso obbligatorio deve essere convalidato.</p><p>Dobbiamo assicurarci che tutte le informazioni richieste siano presenti e, in caso contrario, fornire al client un messaggio di errore chiaro e significativo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/user/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!req.params.id) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`User ID: \" /><text value=\"${req.params.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>400</code>, seguito da <code>\"Missing id parameter\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Convalida i dati obbligatori della route e fornisci al client un errore chiaro se mancano.</p><p>Completa questo ramo difensivo per un ID mancante. Usa lo stato di errore dell’input client e invia <code>Missing id parameter</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/user/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!req.params.id) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`User ID: \" /><text value=\"${req.params.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"500\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;User not found&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>400</code>, seguito da <code>\"Missing id parameter\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 132445,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituiamo <code>404 Not Found</code> se non riusciamo a trovare la risorsa richiesta dal client. Dobbiamo usare <code>return</code> per evitare di tentare di inviare un'altra risposta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/user/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" userId = req.params.id;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = database.find(userId);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!user) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({ \" /><text value=\"error\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;User not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.json({ \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"`User ID: \" /><text value=\"${userId}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\", user });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"170\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>404</code>, seguito da <code>error:</code> e infine <code>\"User not found\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci <code>404 Not Found</code> quando manca la risorsa. Usa <code>return</code> per impedire un'altra risposta.</p><p>Quando l'utente è assente, invia lo stato non trovato con un campo <code>error</code> contenente <code>User not found</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/user/:id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" userId = req.params.id;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user = database.find(userId);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!user) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"404\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").json({ \" /><text value=\"error\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;User not found&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.json({ \" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"`User ID: \" /><text value=\"${userId}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\", user });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"170\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"400\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message:\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>404</code>, seguito da <code>error:</code> e infine <code>\"User not found\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Request Parameters",
            "id": 122449,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è un motivo per cui vogliamo assicurarci di sapere esattamente quali informazioni sta richiedendo il client?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Se il server non ha le informazioni richieste, dovremo generare una risposta di errore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Conoscere esattamente ciò che il client sta richiedendo non è sempre importante</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Se il server non ha le informazioni richieste, dovremo generare una risposta di errore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di rispondere, un server controlla cosa ha richiesto un client. Perché questo controllo è necessario?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La risorsa richiesta potrebbe non esistere e richiedere una risposta di errore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ogni richiesta deve essere convertita in una richiesta POST</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il server può evitare di scegliere uno stato HTTP</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La risorsa richiesta potrebbe non esistere e richiedere una risposta di errore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Set Status",
            "id": 122452,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo possiamo usare per mostrare al client una risposta alla sua richiesta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.format()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.send()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo che un gestore di route prepara una risposta testuale per il client, quale metodo della risposta la consegna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.send()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.status()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.format()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.send()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Set Status",
            "id": 122450,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando il server non dispone dei dati richiesti da un metodo <code>GET</code>, quale codice di stato della risposta HTTP aggiungiamo all'oggetto della risposta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta <code>GET</code> è valida, ma il record richiesto non è nel database. Quale stato deve inviare il server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>404</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>500</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>404</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132447,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi al parametro della query <code>id</code> e salvalo nella variabile denominata <code>id</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" id = req.query.id;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (id === \" /><text value=\"undefined\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`You passed in \" /><text value=\"${req.query.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>.query</code> e infine <code>.id;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi al parametro della query <code>id</code> e salvalo nella variabile denominata <code>id</code>.</p><p>Salva l'<code>id</code> della query della richiesta prima dell'esecuzione del controllo del valore mancante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" id = req.query.id;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (id === \" /><text value=\"undefined\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing id parameter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`You passed in \" /><text value=\"${req.query.id}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".body\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>.query</code> e infine <code>.id;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Back-end Errors",
            "id": 120219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando si verifica un errore, qual è un esempio di risposta appropriata da parte del server?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mostrare all'utente informazioni sull'errore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una richiesta client errata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mostrare all'utente informazioni sull'errore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ricevi una richiesta valida, ma un errore imprevisto del database la interrompe. Quale risposta è adatta?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>500</code> con informazioni sull’errore del server</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>400</code> con <code>Missing id parameter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>404</code> con <code>User not found</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>500</code> con informazioni sull’errore del server.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132449,
            "contentType": "interactive",
